cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HPSS: Hybrid Prefix-Suffix Selection for Compact Textual Key Representations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Alkobrosly
    given-names: Mohamed
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kobros-tech/hpss"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-17
abstract: >-
  Research software for studying compact textual key representations created
  by prefix/suffix character selection, with reproducible collision analysis,
  exhaustive allocation ablations, and benchmark tooling for ASCII-oriented
  textual data.
keywords:
  - hashing
  - string representations
  - collision analysis
  - prefix-suffix selection
  - reproducible research
